 "said": {
  "text": "Appearance switches in console settings and the layout (interface) buttons at the top do nothing. Cause: AxfRuntime.scoped() gives a scope settings = Object.create(base.settings), so set()/clear()/reload() assign this.values on the scoped object and the shared settings never change (Main tab cannot be reached again from GizmoX Night / AmberX Signature). Fix: scoped settings forward every member except get to the shared registry.",
